  "faq_title": "FAQ",
  "faq_desc": "Answers to your most common questions",
  "faq_q1": "What is GRAM MNX?",
  "faq_a1": "GRAM MNX is a small mining app inside Telegram. You can mine Gram through daily claims, completing tasks, inviting friends, and joining gift contests.",
  "faq_q2": "What's the difference between GRAM and MNX?",
  "faq_a2": "Gram is the coin you mine inside the app. MNX is the operating balance you earn from referrals and tasks, used to boost and speed up mining.",
  "faq_q3": "How do I start mining?",
  "faq_a3": "Open the main Mine page, tap the Claim button regularly, and buy mining units to increase your production rate.",
  "faq_q4": "What does Swap / Convert mean?",
  "faq_a4": "Swap lets you convert Gram to MNX or the other way around, at the current in-app rate.",
  "faq_q5": "How does withdrawal work?",
  "faq_a5": "Go to your Profile page, open the \"Wallet\" section, then choose the bottom half \"Withdraw\", enter the amount and your linked wallet, then submit the request. Withdrawals are reviewed and sent manually by the admin.",
  "faq_q6": "Why is withdrawal sometimes delayed?",
  "faq_a6": "Withdrawals are processed manually after admin review. Delays can happen due to network congestion, exceeding the daily limit, a wallet mismatch, or maintenance mode.",
  "faq_q7": "How do I deposit into the app?",
  "faq_a7": "From your Profile page open the \"Wallet\" section, then choose the top half \"Deposit\". Copy the bot's wallet address and send your Gram amount from your wallet. It's added automatically once the network confirms.",
  "faq_q8": "Can I log in without a wallet?",
  "faq_a8": "Yes, you can use the app with just your Telegram account. But to transfer and withdraw funds, you need to link a GRAM wallet.",
  "faq_q9": "What is the daily Combo?",
  "faq_a9": "Combo is a daily game. Pick 3 correct items out of 5 options to complete the combo and win a reward.",
  "faq_q10": "How do I increase my tickets in gift contests?",
  "faq_a10": "Every friend you invite through the gift link increases your tickets in the draw. The more you invite, the higher your odds of winning.",
  "faq_q11": "Why does the mining rate change?",
  "faq_a11": "The mining rate depends on how much MNX you hold and the daily mining percentage set by the admin. The more MNX you have, the more you earn.",
  "faq_q12": "Can I edit my balance or transfer it to another account?",
  "faq_a12": "No, your balance is tied to your Telegram account. It can only be transferred or edited by the admin.",
  "faq_q13": "What are the withdrawal fees?",
  "faq_a13": "A small network fee may apply to withdrawals. The minimum withdrawal amount and current fees are shown on the withdrawal page.",
  "faq_q14": "How do I contact support?",
  "faq_a14": "From your Profile page choose \"Support & Complaints\", then write your message. You'll get a reply as soon as possible.",
